## Problem classes

### `JNI and libzt both loaded fighting UDP`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Bind fail on 9993/9994, or dual hello | Both nodes started | Orchestrator exclusive start; phase-2 spike; isolated process only as last resort (still one identity opener) |

