### `Short zts_bsd_write silently drops bytes`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Large uploads through ZT socket corrupt/truncate; small requests fine | `zts_bsd_write_offset` can return a short count (send buffer full); stock `ZeroTierOutputStream.write` ignores the return value | Loop on the return value until all bytes written (patched in-tree `ZeroTierOutputStream.write`; rebuild AAR per `libzt patch not in APK`) |

